<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75218" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρνῑθ-ίας</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>,
			ὁ, in pl., (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνεμοι</span>) annual winds in spring, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>which brought the birds of passage,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				7.105
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				362a23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mu.</u>
				395a4
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βορέαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PHib.</u>
					27.59
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gem.
				<u>Calend.</u>
				9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Adam.
				<u>Vent.</u>
				44
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νότοι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				45
			</span></i>): hence in <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				877
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειμὼν ὀ.</span> a tempest
				<i>of birds,</i> a <i>fowl</i>-wind. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίας, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, ὁ,</span>
			<i>dealer in birds,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Arg.D.</u>
				19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Tz.
				<u>H.</u>
				6.56
			</span></i>.</div>
